2	 * apps/examples/focscope/scope_ui.c
3	 *
4	 * FOCPilot oscilloscope UI.
5	 *
6	 * Layout (320x480 portrait):
7	 *   title bar  (y=6)      "FOC SCOPE" + RUN/PAUSED state
8	 *   main chart (4,30)     312x202  id/iq current, mA
9	 *   rpm chart  (4,238)    312x94   speed, rpm
10	 *   readouts   (y=336)    id / iq / rpm / Vb live values
11	 *   buttons r1 (y=376)    PAUSE  ZOOM+  ZOOM-  SCALE
12	 *   buttons r2 (y=428)    CLEAR  <      >      CH
13	 *
14	 * Behavior:
15	 *   - Data is polled from the scope_ds_t source in a 50 ms lv_timer
16	 *     callback (single-threaded; all LVGL calls happen inside
17	 *     lv_timer_handler()).
18	 *   - RUN: values scroll in (SHIFT mode). View tools are disabled.
19	 *   - PAUSED: the write cursor is frozen; ZOOM+/ZOOM- (horizontal zoom,
20	 *     x_start_point windowing), < / > (pan) and CLEAR become available.
21	 *   - SCALE cycles the vertical range of the main chart; CH cycles
22	 *     id/iq visibility.
23	 *
24	 * NOTE on v9.1 chart semantics (verified against lv_chart.c):
25	 *   - lv_chart_get_x_start_point() only returns ser->start_point in
26	 *     SHIFT mode; CIRCULAR mode ignores panning.
27	 *   - lv_chart_set_x_start_point() is per-series - set every series.
28	 *   - set_next_value() advances ser->start_point; never touch
29	 *     x_start_point while running.
30	 *   - Zoomed drawing maps point window [start, start+span) onto the
31	 *     content width, span = point_cnt * 256 / zoom_x.
