4	 * FOCPilot oscilloscope UI.
5	 *
6	 * Layout (320x480 portrait):
7	 *   title bar  (y=6)      "FOC SCOPE" + RUN/PAUSED state
8	 *   main chart (4,30)     312x202  id/iq current, mA
