14	 * Behavior:
15	 *   - Data is polled from the scope_ds_t source in a 50 ms lv_timer
16	 *     callback (single-threaded; all LVGL calls happen inside
17	 *     lv_timer_handler()).
18	 *   - RUN: values scroll in (SHIFT mode). View tools are disabled.
19	 *   - PAUSED: the write cursor is frozen; ZOOM+/ZOOM- (horizontal zoom,
