25	 *   - lv_chart_get_x_start_point() only returns ser->start_point in
26	 *     SHIFT mode; CIRCULAR mode ignores panning.
27	 *   - lv_chart_set_x_start_point() is per-series - set every series.
28	 *   - set_next_value() advances ser->start_point; never touch
29	 *     x_start_point while running.
30	 *   - Zoomed drawing maps point window [start, start+span) onto the
31	 *     content width, span = point_cnt * 256 / zoom_x.
